<title>SINGAPORE: Sunright half year net falls six pct.</title>
<headline>Sunright half year net falls six pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Jan 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  4.90    vs    5.22</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	 4.00    vs    4.20</p>
<p>    Turnover		   77.46    vs   72.63</p>
<p>    Other income		0.71    vs    0.49</p>
<p>    Interest expense	  1.50    vs    1.23</p>
<p>    Depreciation		8.89    vs    6.32</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    5.56    vs    8.10</p>
<p>    Income from Associates  2.19    vs    1.03</p>
<p>    Tax			   2.85    vs    2.55</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)	 0.01    vs    1.36 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Sunright Ltd is an electronics company specialising in semiconductor testing.</p>
<p>-- Singapore enwsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
